Package: scholidonline
Type: Package
Title: Online Resolution, Conversion, and Metadata for Scholarly Identifiers
Version: 0.1.0
Language: en-US
Authors@R:
    person("Thomas", "Rauter",
           email = "rauterthomas0@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "fnd"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-5578-3628"))
Description: Provides online utilities for scholarly and academic identifiers,
    building on 'scholid' for identifier detection and normalization. Includes
    functions to check whether identifiers exist in external registries, convert
    identifiers across systems, retrieve basic bibliographic metadata, and
    discover linked identifiers. Designed as a small, stable building block with
    minimal dependencies and CRAN-friendly network usage.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://thomas-rauter.github.io/scholidonline/
